ote=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (sentence truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Biggl(\n\\sigma\\in\n\\operatorname{Preserved}_L\n\\Bigl(\n\\{(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B):\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{ExSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau\n\\bigr)\n\\Biggr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Biggl(\n\\sigma\\in\n\\operatorname{Preserved}_L\n\\Bigl(\n\\{(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B):\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{ExSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau\n\\bigr)\n\\Biggr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The transfer relation is explicitly the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-substructure relation; the theorem does not treat the construction name “Extensions” as an untyped argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-preserved","status":"resolved","id":"7820ef81342beb1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-preserved]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments","status":"resolved","id":"2024ee60951aa39e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-preserved","status":"resolved","id":"7820ef81342beb1d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Preserved}_L$ (preservation operator, see [[17-df-preserved]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments","status":"resolved","id":"2024ee60951aa39e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ExSent}_L$ (existential sentences, see [[17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"